WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.500
In the Shortcuts library, open ことり (Kotori).

2
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:11.000
Touch and hold 記録を追加 (Record Entry) with the microphone icon.

3
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Choose 新規ショートカット (New Shortcut) to create a personal shortcut.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Tap 編集 (Edit) to open the action editor.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Tap 記録内容 (Entry) and choose 毎回尋ねる (Ask Each Time).

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:38.000
Open the name menu at the top and choose 名称変更 (Rename).

7
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.500
Choose a short name, such as 家計簿につけて (Log my spending).

8
00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:50.900
Check the saved name. This video covers setting up the name.
